00:27:02.270 --> 00:27:05.070
It's very humbling to just watch it.
看着它真的让人感到谦卑。

470
00:27:05.210 --> 00:27:07.390
It's just a beautiful, beautiful thing.
这真是一件非常、非常美好的事情。

471
00:27:07.650 --> 00:27:08.770
Thank you so much.
非常感谢你们。

472
00:27:09.170 --> 00:27:09.670
Yeah.
是啊。

473
00:27:09.950 --> 00:27:10.750
Thank you so much.
非常感谢你们。

474
00:27:10.750 --> 00:27:17.210
