上面简单地写着：我们做到了。

1113
00:55:33.600 --> 00:55:38.580
That's one of our inside jokes here at Office Ladies is that if we make it through,
这是我们《办公室女士》节目里的一个内部梗，如果我们熬过了一周，

1114
00:55:38.900 --> 00:55:42.180
a big work week, there was one time we were super tired.
那种超忙的工作周，有一次我们累坏了。

1115
00:55:42.340 --> 00:55:44.960
And at the end of the day, Jenna just sort of like,
在一天结束的时候，珍娜就像是，

1116
00:55:45.380 --> 00:55:49.540
kind of just in that super exhausted state goes, we did it.
在那种精疲力竭的状态下说，我们做到了。

1117
00:55:50.380 --> 00:55:52.040
She was completely deflated.
她当时整个人都泄气了。

1118
00:55:53.100 --> 00:55:57.600
That became something we said to each other all the time when we would hit a big milestone.
后来每当我们达成一个重要的里程碑，这成了我们常对彼此说的话。

1119
00:55:57.920 --> 00:55:59.620
