And Jim pushes Dwight out the door where he is greeted by a man in fatigues who then hands him a bazooka.
然后吉姆把德怀特推下车，一个穿着迷彩服的人迎接了他，并递给他一把火箭筒。

1166
00:58:00.550 --> 00:58:01.970
Dwight is so moved.
德怀特非常感动。

1167
00:58:02.150 --> 00:58:02.930
He looks at Jim.
他看着吉姆。

1168
00:58:03.090 --> 00:58:04.670
They're smoking cigars, by the way.
顺便说一下，他们当时在抽雪茄。

1169
00:58:04.810 --> 00:58:06.310
And he says, you remembered.
他说，你还记得。

1170
00:58:06.590 --> 00:58:08.130
And Jim goes, of course I did.
吉姆说，我当然记得。

1171
00:58:08.130 --> 00:58:11.630
And then Dwight says to the man in fatigues, get out of my way.
然后德怀特对那个穿迷彩服的人说，让开。

1172
00:58:13.030 --> 00:58:14.530
He takes the bazooka.
他拿过火箭筒。

1173
00:58:14.690 --> 00:58:16.350
He blows up some oil druMs.
他炸掉了一些油桶。

1174
00:58:16.650 --> 00:58:19.490
We had a question from Lena H.
我们收到了莉娜·H的问题。

1175
00:58:19.630 --> 00:58:27.310
