他们有一个包间。

1197
00:59:29.350 --> 00:59:33.410
I want to point out that Oscar, still trying to fit in, says, yeah, Broseph.
我想指出的是，奥斯卡还在努力融入大家，他说，没错，兄弟。

1198
01:00:01.990 --> 01:00:03.390
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1199
01:00:03.390 --> 01:00:07.410
Catchings in the table from some lunches that he would have with his animators.
这是他与动画师共进午餐时在桌上留下的痕迹。

1200
01:00:07.850 --> 01:00:11.270
Whitney said it's an adorable place with so much history and charm.
惠特尼说这是一个充满历史和魅力，非常可爱的地方。

1201
01:00:11.710 --> 01:00:13.810
I've driven past it so many times.
我开车经过那里很多次了。

1202
01:00:13.890 --> 01:00:14.190
Same.
我也是。

1203
01:00:14.330 --> 01:00:16.330
It looks so cute, but I've never been inside.
它看起来很可爱，但我从来没进去过。

1204
01:00:16.330 --> 01:00:18.490
Well, it's a Scottish steakhouse.
嗯，那是一家苏格兰牛排馆。

1205
01:00:18.710 --> 01:00:23.570
It's been there over 100 years and has been owned by the same family ever since it opened.
它在那里开了100多年了，而且自开业以来一直由同一个家族经营。

1206
01:00:23.850 --> 01:00:33.830
It was opened by Lawrence Frank and Walter Vandekamp, who incidentally are the founders of Vandekamp's Holland Dutch Bakeries.
它是由劳伦斯·弗兰克和沃尔特·范德坎普开设的，顺便提一下，他们也是范德坎普荷兰荷兰烘焙坊的创始人。

1207
01:00:33.830 --> 01:00:39.390
Then they went on to found Lowry's Restaurant Chain and Seasoning Company.
后来他们又创立了劳瑞餐厅连锁店和调味品公司。

1208
01:00:39.410 --> 01:00:39.770
No way.
不会吧。

1209
01:00:40.050 --> 01:00:40.290
Yes.
是真的。

1210
01:00:40.290 --> 01:00:41.510
We love Lowry's.
我们很喜欢劳瑞的产品。

1211
01:00:41.590 --> 01:00:44.390
Remember, they sent us our own seasoning with our faces on it?
还记得吗，他们给我们寄过印有我们头像的专属调味料？

1212
01:00:44.430 --> 01:00:44.790
Yes.
记得。

1213
01:00:45.170 --> 01:00:52.110
And if you look at the tables in the restaurant, they have little Lowry's Seasoning Spices on the table.
而且如果你看看餐厅里的桌子，上面都放着小瓶的劳瑞调味香料。

1214
01:00:52.350 --> 01:00:53.770
Well, this place sounds too cute.
好吧，这地方听起来太可爱了。

1215
01:00:53.770 --> 01:00:54.770
I want to finally go.
我终于想去看看了。

1216
01:00:55.050 --> 01:00:55.730
We should.
我们应该去。

1217
01:00:56.250 --> 01:01:00.650
As the guys are walking into their private room, Andy is made fun of once again.
当男士们走进他们的包间时，安迪又一次被取笑了。

1218
01:01:00.850 --> 01:01:06.190
And you can tell Daryl is starting to really sympathize with how much Andy has had to put up with this.
你可以看出达里尔开始真正同情安迪所承受的一切了。

1219
01:01:06.350 --> 01:01:08.730
But Andy has such a great life outlook.
但安迪的人生态度非常好。

1220
01:01:08.970 --> 01:01:09.950
He says, you know what?
他说，你知道吗？

1221
01:01:10.070 --> 01:01:11.650
Things are actually going really well.
事情其实进展得很顺利。

1222
01:01:11.850 --> 01:01:17.210
I spoke at the Cornell commencement, and I guess the seniors invited me as a joke, but it was a huge success.
我在康奈尔大学的毕业典礼上发了言，我想大四学生邀请我只是为了开个玩笑，但结果非常成功。

1223
01:01:17.210 --> 01:01:19.290
And now I've been hired there.
现在我已经被那里录用了。

1224
01:01:19.470 --> 01:01:20.370
I work in admissions.
我在招生办工作。

1225
01:01:20.910 --> 01:01:24.270
That is definitely Andy's dream job, to work at Cornell.
那绝对是安迪梦寐以求的工作，在康奈尔大学工作。

1226
01:01:24.550 --> 01:01:25.650
It's perfect.
太完美了。

1227
01:01:25.730 --> 01:01:26.370
Yes.
是的。

1228
01:01:26.710 --> 01:01:29.570
And it seems like Oscar and Daryl still feel bad for him.
看起来奥斯卡和达里尔仍然为他感到难过。

1229
01:01:29.710 --> 01:01:31.110
And I'm like, stop feeling bad for him.
而我的想法是，别再为他难过了。

1230
01:01:31.170 --> 01:01:31.730
He's happy.
他很幸福。

1231
01:01:31.870 --> 01:01:32.530
He's happy.
他很幸福。

1232
