There is a trend here that everyone just kept their same names, Malcolm, Dakota, and Rachel.
这里有个趋势，每个人都保留了他们原来的名字，马尔科姆、达科塔和瑞秋。

1236
01:01:49.610 --> 01:01:49.890
Yes.
是的。

1237
01:01:50.450 --> 01:01:52.950
Greg was too tired to name people at this point.
格雷格当时太累了，懒得给角色起新名字了。

1238
01:01:53.230 --> 01:01:53.690
Yes.
没错。

1239
01:01:55.050 --> 01:01:57.950
Well, Rachel was played by Rachel Harris.
瑞秋是由瑞秋·哈里斯饰演的。

1240
01:01:58.310 --> 01:02:00.510
I have known her for a really long time.
我认识她很久了。

1241
01:02:00.950 --> 01:02:03.230
Warren and I knew her from our days at the Groundlings.
沃伦和我从在“接地气”剧团（Groundlings）的日子起就认识她了。

1242
01:02:03.630 --> 01:02:06.590
She is hilarious, incredibly talented.
她非常搞笑，才华横溢。

1243
01:02:06.590 --> 01:02:09.970
I mean, she's been in everything, you name it.
我是说，她演过各种作品，数不胜数。

1244
01:02:10.210 --> 01:02:13.670
She was in Suits, and right now it's having a whole resurgence on Netflix.
她演过《金装律师》，现在这部剧在网飞上又火了一把。

1245
01:02:14.210 --> 01:02:18.830
She was also in Lucifer and just a ton, a ton of movies and television shows.
她还演过《路西法》，以及数不清的电影和电视剧。

1246
01:02:19.010 --> 01:02:20.190
She's a really funny gal.
她是个非常有趣的姑娘。

1247
01:02:20.190 --> 01:02:23.370
And, you know, she was in the Hangover movie with Ed HelMs.
而且，你知道，她还和艾德·赫尔姆斯一起演过《宿醉》。

1248
01:02:23.550 --> 01:02:24.050
That's right.
没错。

1249
01:02:24.150 --> 01:02:24.410
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1250
01:02:25.050 --> 01:02:29.390
Well, we got a fan mail flurry about this, Angela, and several bulls**t cards.
好了，安吉拉，我们收到了很多关于这集的粉丝来信，还有几张胡扯的卡片。

1251
01:02:29.610 --> 01:02:30.430
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1252
01:02:30.490 --> 01:02:30.710
Okay.
好吧。

1253
01:02:31.410 --> 01:02:32.430
Here's what they said.
他们是这么说的。

1254
01:02:32.790 --> 01:02:36.730
In a previous episode, Angela said she hasn't spoken to her sister in 16 years.
在之前的一集里，安吉拉说她已经16年没和她姐姐说过话了。

1255
01:02:36.890 --> 01:02:37.290
It's true.
这是真的。

1256
01:02:37.290 --> 01:02:39.570
In this episode, she mentions how close they are.
但在这一集里，她又提到了她们关系有多亲密。

1257
01:02:39.730 --> 01:02:42.130
Is this the same sister or a different one?
这是同一个姐姐还是另一个？

1258
01:02:42.390 --> 01:02:43.930
I think it's a different sister.
我觉得是另一个姐姐。

1259
01:02:44.410 --> 01:02:44.750
Oh.
哦。

1260
01:02:44.990 --> 01:02:48.270
So there's a sister who was not invited to the wedding, and then there's this sister.
所以有一个姐姐没被邀请参加婚礼，然后还有这个姐姐。

1261
01:02:48.310 --> 01:02:48.750
Absolutely.
绝对是这样。

1262
01:02:48.790 --> 01:02:50.330
That you have a special language with.
你们之间有种特殊的交流方式。

1263
01:02:50.570 --> 01:02:51.010
Exactly.
没错。

1264
01:02:51.010 --> 01:02:51.630
Okay.
好吧。

1265
01:02:52.490 --> 01:02:57.570
Well, I'd like to say that this was one of my pitches to Greg as we were discussing wrapping up the show.
我想说，这是我在和格雷格讨论剧集收尾时提出的方案之一。

1266
01:02:57.790 --> 01:03:01.430
I didn't pitch the idea for a bachelorette party or anything like that.
我并没有提议要办单身女郎派对之类的东西。

1267
01:03:01.610 --> 01:03:13.610
All I said was, before this show is over, I would like a scene of all the women together, just like we had in Boys and Girls or when we went to the mall with Michael.
我只是说，在剧集结束前，我想要一个所有女性角色聚在一起的场景，就像我们在《男孩与女孩》那一集，或者和迈克尔一起去商场时那样。

1268
01:03:13.970 --> 01:03:18.690
I just wanted one more moment of gals before the show ended.
我只是想在剧集结束前再来一次闺蜜聚会。

1269
01:03:18.690 --> 01:03:23.950
And so I absolutely loved this night of shooting.
所以我非常喜欢拍摄这一晚。

1270
01:03:24.150 --> 01:03:26.650
It was maybe one of my favorite of the finale.
这可能是我在大结局中最喜欢的场景之一。

1271
01:03:27.210 --> 01:03:28.790
I'll get to the other one.
另一个我之后会提到。

1272
01:03:29.590 --> 01:03:31.630
But it felt like a slumber party.
感觉就像睡衣派对一样。

1273
01:03:31.970 --> 01:03:33.510
It was so fun.
太好玩了。

1274
01:03:34.350 --> 01:03:38.510
When you watch this and you see us laughing, we're just laughing in real life.
当你看到这一幕，看到我们在笑的时候，我们是真的在现实生活中笑。

1275
01:03:38.610 --> 01:03:40.170
We were cracking up the whole night.
我们整晚都在大笑。

1276
01:03:40.890 --> 01:03:42.690
I remember the snack table.
我记得那个零食桌。

1277
01:03:43.150 --> 01:03:46.490
There were these Trader Joe's rosemary crackers.
上面有那种缺德舅的迷迭香饼干。

1278
01:03:46.490 --> 01:03:49.050
You and Ellie were obsessed with them.
你和艾莉当时对它们简直着了迷。

1279
01:03:49.470 --> 01:03:51.790
We ate like three boxes of those crackers.
我们吃了大概三盒那种饼干。

1280
01:03:52.450 --> 01:03:57.870
And then later for my birthday, she surprised me with a giant jar of them.
后来在我生日的时候，她还给了我一个巨大的罐子装满了那种饼干作为惊喜。

1281
01:03:59.070 --> 01:04:01.910
I also had a sweater in this scene.
这一幕里我其实还有一件毛衣。

1282
01:04:02.070 --> 01:04:04.670
You never see me wearing it, but it was part of my wardrobe.
你从来没见我穿过它，但它确实是我戏服的一部分。

1283
01:04:05.130 --> 01:04:07.590
And it was a little chilly at this location.
拍摄地点当时有点冷。

1284
01:04:07.590 --> 01:04:08.910
And I would put it on.
我就会把它穿上。

1285
01:04:09.250 --> 01:04:13.950
I don't know why I didn't end up wearing it in the scene, but I had it.
我不知道为什么最后没在戏里穿它，但我确实带着它。

1286
01:04:14.050 --> 01:04:16.210
And I would put it on in between takes.
我在拍摄间隙会把它穿上。

1287
01:04:16.670 --> 01:04:17.830
And I kept it.
而且我把它留下了。

1288
01:04:18.190 --> 01:04:18.630
Aw.
噢。

1289
01:04:18.870 --> 01:04:19.550
I still have it.
我现在还留着它。

1290
01:04:19.590 --> 01:04:23.150
It's the sweater that I keep on the back of my office chair at home.
那件毛衣我现在就放在家里办公椅的椅背上。

1291
01:04:23.830 --> 01:04:25.310
Well, I kept those Uggs.
好吧，我留下了那双雪地靴。

1292
01:04:25.970 --> 01:04:28.750
Oh, Angela, we got a question about your Uggs.
噢，安吉拉，我们收到一个关于你雪地靴的问题。

1293
01:04:29.370 --> 01:04:33.770
People wanted to know if those were the Uggs that you would wear at your desk when your feet were cold.
大家想知道那是不是你脚冷时在办公桌下穿的那双雪地靴。

1294
01:04:34.090 --> 01:04:34.570
Absolutely.
绝对是。

1295
01:04:35.610 --> 01:04:39.890
This was my happiest scene because I was wearing my cozy warm Uggs.
这是我最开心的一场戏，因为我穿着舒适温暖的雪地靴。

1296
01:04:39.970 --> 01:04:41.550
I kept my Uggs as well.
我也留下了我的雪地靴。

1297
01:04:41.710 --> 01:04:45.990
And I don't know about you, but on the sole of my Ugg in the very back,
我不知道你那边怎么样，但在我雪地靴鞋底的最末端，

1298
01:04:46.170 --> 01:04:49.270
written in teeny tiny black marker, it says, Pam.
用极小的黑色记号笔写着“帕姆”。

1299
01:04:49.670 --> 01:04:50.050
Yes.
是的。

1300
01:04:50.310 --> 01:04:51.490
Mine says by name.
我的上面写着我的名字。

1301
01:04:51.610 --> 01:04:52.090
I guess.
我想是吧。

1302
01:04:52.390 --> 01:04:52.890
There you go.
这就对了。

1303
01:04:53.490 --> 01:04:57.250
I would like to point out a fantastic look to camera by Phyllis.
我想指出菲利斯对着镜头露出的那个绝妙表情。

1304
01:04:57.390 --> 01:04:59.230
It's at 12 minutes and 42 seconds.
就在12分42秒的时候。

1305
01:04:59.530 --> 01:05:00.850
It is so funny.
太搞笑了。

1306
01:05:01.150 --> 01:05:03.850
So Rachel and Angela are speaking their made-up language.
瑞秋和安吉拉当时在说她们自创的语言。

1307
01:05:04.050 --> 01:05:05.670
And in the shooting draft, it said this.
而在拍摄剧本里是这样写的。

1308
01:05:05.950 --> 01:05:07.570
Rachel glances at Phyllis.
瑞秋瞥了菲利斯一眼。

1309
01:05:07.930 --> 01:05:09.310
Angela starts cracking up.
安吉拉开始大笑起来。

1310
01:05:09.730 --> 01:05:11.750
Phyllis looks to camera pissed.
菲利斯对着镜头露出了恼火的表情。

1311
01:05:12.430 --> 01:05:13.770
It's a pretty great look.
那个表情真是太棒了。

1312
01:05:13.930 --> 01:05:14.730
It's a great look.
真是个绝妙的表情。

1313
01:05:15.050 --> 01:05:22.350
One other thing I want to point out is Phyllis is seriously maybe who you want to invite to a party
我还想指出一点，菲利斯绝对是你派对上最想邀请的人，

1314
01:05:22.350 --> 01:05:24.830
because she shows up with a blender under her arm.
因为她会夹着一台搅拌机就来了。

1315
01:05:27.910 --> 01:05:32.570
Back at the bachelor party, guess who walks in the door?
回到单身派对现场，猜猜谁进门了？

1316
01:05:34.310 --> 01:05:36.150
It's Elizabeth the stripper.
是脱衣舞娘伊丽莎白。

1317
01:05:36.730 --> 01:05:37.250
Yes.
没错。

1318
01:05:37.570 --> 01:05:39.890
Not the waitress, which Dwight is hoping for.
不是德怀特期待的那位女服务员。

1319
01:05:40.010 --> 01:05:41.270
He really wants to get his food.
他真的很想吃到他的食物。

1320
01:05:41.490 --> 01:05:44.550
I have another Easter egg here, another callback.
我这里还有个彩蛋，另一个呼应点。

1321
01:05:44.550 --> 01:05:50.690
Per the shooting draft, it says a stripper in a trashy waitress outfit that looks like the St.
根据拍摄剧本，上面写着一个穿着廉价女服务员制服的脱衣舞娘，看起来像圣波利女孩，

1322
01:05:50.830 --> 01:05:53.410
Polly girl comes in with a boombox.
带着一台手提音响走了进来。

1323
01:05:53.590 --> 01:05:54.010
St.
圣。

1324
01:05:54.210 --> 01:05:54.770
Polly girl.
波利女孩。

1325
01:05:55.010 --> 01:05:56.670
Polly girl from dinner party.
就是“晚宴”那一集里的波利女孩。

1326
01:05:56.950 --> 01:06:00.850
Guys, this is the return of the very funny Jackie DeBotten.
伙计们，这是非常有趣的杰基·德博滕的回归。

1327
01:06:01.030 --> 01:06:02.490
She was in Ben Franklin.
她演过“本·富兰克林”那一集。

1328
01:06:02.490 --> 01:06:03.830
She was in Fun Run.
她演过“趣味长跑”那一集。

1329
01:06:04.170 --> 01:06:05.270
Here she is in Finale.
现在她又出现在了“大结局”里。

1330
01:06:05.510 --> 01:06:09.470
I just love the idea that there's just one stripper in Scranton.
我就是喜欢这种设定，斯克兰顿好像就只有这一个脱衣舞娘。

1331
01:06:09.650 --> 01:06:10.890
And it's Elizabeth.
而且就是伊丽莎白。

1332
01:06:11.350 --> 01:06:11.850
That's right.
没错。

1333
01:06:11.970 --> 01:06:12.970
She's cornered the market.
她垄断了整个市场。

1334
01:06:12.970 --> 01:06:16.490
You know, I ran into Jackie at the office convention in Miami.
你们知道吗，我在迈阿密的办公室大会上偶遇了杰基。

1335
01:06:16.650 --> 01:06:19.730
And she would love to talk to us about her time on the show.
她很乐意跟我们聊聊她在剧组的那段时光。

1336
01:06:19.730 --> 01:06:22.610
And I feel like she's got to come on for Office Lady 6.0.
我觉得她一定要来参加《办公室女士》6.0版本。

1337
01:06:22.710 --> 01:06:23.510
I would love it.
我太期待了。

1338
01:06:24.510 --> 01:06:28.630
Well, Elizabeth is not the only stripper in Scranton.
好吧，伊丽莎白并不是斯克兰顿唯一的脱衣舞娘。

1339
01:06:28.850 --> 01:06:30.650
There is a male stripper as well.
还有一个男脱衣舞男。

1340
01:06:30.710 --> 01:06:33.790
And he's going to show up to Angela's bachelorette party.
他会出现在安吉拉的单身派对上。

1341
01:06:34.330 --> 01:06:35.710
Yeah, he does.
没错，他确实来了。

1342
01:06:35.990 --> 01:06:38.330
And right away, Meredith goes,
然后梅雷迪斯立刻说道：

1343
01:06:38.870 --> 01:06:39.350
Jakey?
杰基？

1344
01:06:40.490 --> 01:06:41.790
And he's like, Mom?
他回道：妈？

1345
01:06:42.110 --> 01:06:43.990
And Pam's like, wait, wait, wait, what, what?
帕姆一脸震惊：等等，等等，什么，什么情况？

1346
01:06:44.330 --> 01:06:45.950
And then Meredith's like, no, no, no.
然后梅雷迪斯说：不，不，不。

1347
01:06:46.130 --> 01:06:46.830
Just do your work.
继续干你的活。

1348
01:06:46.990 --> 01:06:47.930
Pretend Mom's not here.
假装我不在场。

1349
01:06:49.330 --> 01:06:50.650
This is craziness.
这简直太疯狂了。

1350
01:06:51.130 --> 01:06:53.810
Lady, I remember when we read this in the table read.
女士，我记得我们在剧本围读会上读到这段的时候。

1351
01:06:54.250 --> 01:06:59.350
And it was revealed that Meredith's son was going to strip at Angela's bachelor party.
结果揭晓，梅雷迪思的儿子要在安吉拉的单身派对上跳脱衣舞。

1352
01:06:59.530 --> 01:07:00.590
It was so funny.
太搞笑了。

1353
01:07:00.590 --> 01:07:02.270
It was the funniest thing to me.
我觉得那是最搞笑的部分。

1354
01:07:02.270 --> 01:07:03.790
People were cracking up.
大家都笑疯了。

1355
01:07:03.970 --> 01:07:09.830
I remember in particular at your line when you go, woo-hoo, go Meredith's stripper's son.
我特别记得你那句台词，你说：呜呼，梅雷迪思的脱衣舞男儿子加油。

1356
01:07:10.150 --> 01:07:12.050
It was like so ridiculous.
简直太荒唐了。

1357
01:07:12.890 --> 01:07:13.510
So awkward.
太尴尬了。

1358
01:07:14.110 --> 01:07:24.770
Meredith's son, Jake, was played by Spencer Daniels, the same person who played him in Take Your Daughter to Work Day, which is when we met Meredith's son for the first time.
梅雷迪思的儿子杰克由斯宾塞·丹尼尔斯饰演，他在《带女儿上班日》里也演过这个角色，那是我们第一次见到梅雷迪思的儿子。

1359
01:07:24.770 --> 01:07:29.610
Yes, he is much older now, and as Meredith says, is a little entrepreneur.
没错，他现在大多了，正如梅雷迪思所说，他是个小企业家。

1360
01:07:30.850 --> 01:07:35.590
He's going to do a strip tease to the song Save a Horse, Ride a Cowboy by Big and Rich.
他要伴着Big and Rich组合的《Save a Horse, Ride a Cowboy》跳脱衣舞。

1361
01:07:35.590 --> 01:07:39.270
It cost us $48,000 for this song.
这首歌花了我们4.8万美元。

1362
01:07:39.450 --> 01:07:40.490
That's pricey.
真贵啊。

1363
01:07:40.490 --> 01:07:41.930
It's so perfect, though.
不过这首歌太完美了。

1364
01:07:42.690 --> 01:07:48.270
This dance that he does is so perfectly funny.
他跳的那段舞简直滑稽得恰到好处。

1365
01:07:48.830 --> 01:08:00.910
And when Meredith pushes him out of the way and then is, like, trying to show him a better way to kind of thrust his pelvis at you, it's just, lady, how did you get through it?
当梅雷迪思把他推开，然后试图向他展示如何更好地对着你扭动骨盆时，天哪，你是怎么忍住没笑场的？

1366
01:08:01.110 --> 01:08:02.310
I covered my face.
我捂住了脸。

1367
01:08:02.310 --> 01:08:02.870
I saw.
我看到了。

1368
01:08:03.150 --> 01:08:05.010
I covered my face for many reasons.
我捂脸是有很多原因的。

1369
01:08:05.190 --> 01:08:06.790
One, it was so uncomfortable.
第一，太让人不舒服了。

1370
01:08:07.550 --> 01:08:08.050
Sure.
确实。

1371
01:08:08.470 --> 01:08:09.270
It was so uncomfortable.
真的太不舒服了。

1372
01:08:09.270 --> 01:08:15.130
I was, like, legitimately just, like, oh, no, I feel so, like, ah, this is crazy.
我当时真的就是，天哪，不行，我感觉太，啊，这太疯狂了。

1373
01:08:16.110 --> 01:08:19.410
So I covered my face, but I also covered my face because I was laughing.
所以我捂住了脸，但我也捂住了脸，因为我在笑。

1374
01:08:19.670 --> 01:08:22.430
And also, you guys were laughing.
而且你们当时也在笑。

1375
01:08:23.570 --> 01:08:24.750
Ellie was laughing.
艾莉也在笑。

1376
01:08:25.050 --> 01:08:25.390
Yeah.
是啊。

1377
01:08:25.970 --> 01:08:28.450
You could see it in a few shots.
在几个镜头里都能看出来。

1378
01:08:29.110 --> 01:08:32.210
You know to never get me a stripper for a party, right?
你知道永远别给我找脱衣舞男来派对，对吧？

1379
01:08:32.210 --> 01:08:33.370
You know I don't want that.
你知道我不想要那种东西。

1380
01:08:33.770 --> 01:08:34.590
I would never.
我绝不会那么做。

1381
01:08:34.630 --> 01:08:35.790
Why would I do that?
我为什么要那么做？

1382
01:08:36.070 --> 01:08:36.750
I don't know.
我不知道。

1383
01:08:36.930 --> 01:08:38.770
I'm just, I mean, we know this, right?
我只是，我是说，我们都知道这一点，对吧？

1384
01:08:38.770 --> 01:08:39.810
I can't do it.
我受不了。

1385
01:08:39.910 --> 01:08:40.130
This is not for me.
这不适合我。

1386
01:08:40.230 --> 01:08:41.030
I can't do it.
我真的受不了。

1387
01:08:41.190 --> 01:08:42.310
I would never do it for you.
我绝不会为你找脱衣舞男的。

1388
01:08:42.450 --> 01:08:43.930
I have too much backstory.
我有太多的心理阴影了。

1389
01:08:44.050 --> 01:08:47.350
I want to know, like, okay, why did you pick this outfit?
我想知道，好吧，你为什么选这套衣服？

1390
01:08:47.770 --> 01:08:49.050
Why did you pick this song?
你为什么选这首歌？

1391
01:08:49.150 --> 01:08:51.390
That's why you can't have a stripper is because.
这就是为什么你不能找脱衣舞男，因为。

1392
01:08:51.390 --> 01:08:53.110
Where have you studied dance class?
你在哪学的舞蹈课？

1393
01:08:53.370 --> 01:08:55.550
This is what keeps your process.
这就是你的创作过程。

1394
01:08:56.190 --> 01:08:56.430
Okay.
好吧。

1395
01:08:57.350 --> 01:08:58.370
This is very different.
这完全是两码事。

1396
01:08:58.810 --> 01:08:59.970
Well, what is your thing?
那你的原则是什么？

1397
01:09:00.610 --> 01:09:03.330
I don't want people dancing up on me who are a stranger.
我不希望陌生人对着我跳舞。

1398
01:09:03.850 --> 01:09:04.330
Oh.
噢。

1399
