Hmm.
嗯。

1960
01:35:58.170 --> 01:36:01.490
They sat apart during the panel, and they don't appear together at the wedding.
他们在座谈会上坐得很开，而且在婚礼上也没一起出现。

1961
01:36:01.730 --> 01:36:02.390
Please discuss.
请讨论一下。

1962
01:36:02.970 --> 01:36:07.650
Well, we asked Jake Lacey this question when we interviewed him, and he said he doesn't
嗯，我们在采访杰克·莱西时问过他这个问题，他说他不

1963
