There is no real evidence in the script.
剧本里并没有确凿的证据。

1967
01:36:14.070 --> 01:36:18.790
However, it was scripted for them to be sitting next to each other on the panel.
不过，剧本里原本安排他们坐在座谈会的相邻位置。

1968
