他留着满脸胡子。

1984
01:37:07.110 --> 01:37:09.950
He is watching all of it and tearing up.
他看着这一切，热泪盈眶。

1985
01:37:09.950 --> 01:37:16.010
Well, Angela, like I said, I was really happy for you because you were off this day.
安吉拉，就像我说的，我真为你感到高兴，因为那天你休息。

1986
01:37:16.010 --> 01:37:19.390
You were getting to pursue this opportunity that was so special.
你当时正要去追求那个非常特别的机会。

1987
01:37:19.770 --> 01:37:26.330
But at the end of this scene, when we finished our last shot, I'm getting choked up thinking
但在这一幕结束时，当我们拍完最后一个镜头，想到这里

