1999
01:37:51.130 --> 01:37:51.450
Yeah.
是的。

2000
01:37:51.710 --> 01:37:52.890
It was really special.
真的很特别。

2001
01:37:53.230 --> 01:37:55.850
Man, it's been great to rewatch these scenes.
