2002
01:37:56.050 --> 01:37:58.790
The ones I wasn't in, I got to sort of experience them.
那些我没参与的剧集，我算是以另一种方式体验了它们。

2003
01:37:59.090 --> 01:38:00.650
And I've really loved it.
而且我真的很喜欢这种感觉。

2004
01:38:00.830 --> 01:38:01.370
Me too.
我也是。

2005
01:38:01.930 --> 01:38:05.170
Well, listen, that is finale part one.
好了，听着，这就是大结局的第一部分。

2006
01:38:05.170 --> 01:38:06.510
Oh, my goodness.
天哪。

2007
01:38:06.730 --> 01:38:08.770
This is a long episode, y'all.
这一集可真长啊，各位。

2008
01:38:09.050 --> 01:38:10.410
That was 50 pages.
足足有50页。

2009
01:38:10.770 --> 01:38:12.530
My document was 50 pages.
我的文档有50页长。

2010
01:38:12.810 --> 01:38:14.410
And we're only halfway through.
而我们才讲到一半。

2011
01:38:14.450 --> 01:38:20.070
Next week, it's all about the wedding and all about a very special surprise gueSt.
下周，我们将聚焦婚礼，还有一位非常特别的惊喜嘉宾。

2012
01:38:20.070 --> 01:38:23.150
Yes, and I am bringing in some stuff.
没错，我还会带些东西过来。

2013
01:38:23.370 --> 01:38:24.830
There's going to be some show and tell.
会有一些展示环节。

2014
01:38:25.010 --> 01:38:30.470
I know it's a podcast, but I have found some real nuggets from way back when.
我知道这是个播客，但我确实找到了一些很久以前的珍贵资料。

2015
01:38:30.470 --> 01:38:31.810
I'll be bringing them in.
我会把它们带过来。

2016
01:38:31.930 --> 01:38:33.610
I'll share them in stories as well.
我也会在故事里分享它们。

2017
01:38:33.610 --> 01:38:41.010
What a wonderful, amazing, fantastic ride this rewatch has been.
这次重温之旅真是太美妙、太神奇、太棒了。

2018
01:38:41.450 --> 01:38:43.630
And there'll be more to come of Office Ladies.
《办公室女士》未来还会有更多内容。

2019
01:38:43.870 --> 01:38:46.790
But I mean, I am just sitting in some gratitude.
但我现在只想表达我的感激之情。

2020
01:38:47.050 --> 01:38:48.890
I just love y'all so much.
我真的非常爱你们大家。

2021
01:38:49.250 --> 01:38:54.070
And I love this team of these faces I'm looking at, Sam and Cassie and Jenna.
我也爱这个团队，看着眼前这些面孔，山姆、凯西和珍娜。

2022
01:38:54.530 --> 01:38:56.210
I just want to say thanks.
我只想说声谢谢。

2023
01:38:56.870 --> 01:38:58.410
We'll see y'all next week.
我们下周见。

2024
01:38:58.610 --> 01:38:59.610
See you next week.
下周见。

2025
01:38:59.610 --> 01:39:09.330
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

2026
